{"seq":18,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/sy-02-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:09:14.175Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"bb4037d522cbe59753f3ac0ff6b0d13401c4bcdc1fe4026a70dc2a54855a1fc9","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Hi Tobias, I found three ticket numbers for Marrow Fieldworks:\n\n*From Moss's note \"Central handoffs next week\" (2 Jan 2026, public)*\n• *#4409*: recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake)\n• *#4412*: minor glitch in the driver SMS prompt when combine trailers are staged on unpaved overflow lots\nHollis flagged both as open before the account changed hands on Mon 5 Jan 2026. The note calls the account \"Pree's dealer account\" at that point.\n\n*From #central-random (13 Oct, 09:27)*\n• *#8841*: West yard Door 2 is still double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk. You flagged this to support after checking whether the webhook patch fixed the tractor-bay alerts.\n\nOne caveat: that #central-random thread says \"Tobias's dealer account\", not Marrow Fieldworks by name. I counted #8841 because the handoff note ties \"dealer account\" to Marrow Fieldworks, but please check it's the right account.\n\nNot included: FR-882 in the same Moss note. That's a feature request from Marrow Agrisupply, a different account. None of Moss's other notes mention Marrow Fieldworks."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
{"seq":19,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/sy-02-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:09:19.655Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"2c242ff8364115d93d839a32876ba45f09e1a0226774e45cbf972526fbed708e","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I've sent Tobias the list in his DM. There are three Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers, and one of them is an inference he needs to check.\n\n- **#4409**, from Moss's note \"Central handoffs next week\" (2 Jan 2026): a report on the Gatehouse Check-In screen keeps timing out at the Salina North yard. Hollis flagged it as open before the account changed hands on 5 Jan 2026.\n- **#4412**, from the same note: a minor glitch in the text-message prompt drivers get. Hollis flagged it as open at the same time.\n- **#8841**, from #central-random (13 Oct, 09:27): Tobias flagged it himself because West yard Door 2 is still double-booking flatbeds that check in early. That thread says \"Tobias's dealer account\", not Marrow Fieldworks. I counted it because the handoff note calls Marrow Fieldworks \"Pree's dealer account\" before it changed hands. I asked him to confirm it's the right account.\n\nI left out FR-882 from the same Moss note, because it's a feature request from Marrow Agrisupply, a different account. Marrow Fieldworks doesn't come up in any of Moss's other notes.\n\nTobias can see everything I used: he's a member of #central-random, and Moss's notes are public. There are no money terms in any of it, so no approval was needed.\n\nThe brain's search was running on keyword matching only, and some pages haven't been checked for company names yet. I checked Moss's notes and the channel directly, but a page elsewhere that refers to the account by another name could have been missed."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000125"}}
